menuconfig MODULES_CORE
	bool "core"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable core module.

		Diagnostic module that subscribes to a handful of uORB topics and
		prints a status block once a second. Off by default: with
		"default y" it was silently compiled into every board, and its
		once-a-second output drowns out anything else on the console.
		Boards that want it enable it explicitly in their .px4board.
